    <briefdescription>
<para>Result of a <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1_t_s_store_1a2b54cb6bf7aeb4a1429a5e0fc6ce3f26" kindref="member">putBatch()</ref></computeroutput> call. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>On full success <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_t_s_store_1_1_batch_write_result_1a5a3727ffba95cfb60f7fa740af07b005" kindref="member">failed_count</ref> == 0</computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_t_s_store_1_1_batch_write_result_1ab81838c0fd57d4273299055140fa150b" kindref="member">row_errors</ref></computeroutput> is empty. On partial validation failure some rows may be rejected before the <computeroutput>WriteBatch</computeroutput> is submitted; in that case the entire RocksDB write is still attempted with the valid rows only (no atomicity across invalid rows).</para>
<para>On a RocksDB write failure the whole batch is rejected and <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1_t_s_store_1_1_batch_write_result_1a5a3727ffba95cfb60f7fa740af07b005" kindref="member">failed_count</ref> == total rows</computeroutput>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
